WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.975
Section 2.

00:00:01.925 --> 00:00:04.162
The Mark Norman Case.

00:00:04.162 --> 00:00:11.375
The Vice-Admiral was destroyed for ensuring a critical naval supply contract wasn't killed by political interference.

00:00:11.375 --> 00:00:18.450
The charges collapsed, but the message was unmistakable: challenge political interference and we will destroy you.
